WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.633 --> 00:00:08.033
The moon is up and the hounds are out.

00:00:08.434 --> 00:00:12.034
This is Axle Sullivan for the WCZS campus radio stream

00:00:12.513 --> 00:00:14.913
wishing you all a wicked Halloween.

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:17.580
Get ready to fire up those speakers,

00:00:17.973 --> 00:00:21.893
because I've got a horde of infectious tunes headed atcha.

00:00:22.154 --> 00:00:24.634
...but first a word from our sponsor.

00:00:57.855 --> 00:00:58.895
Axle: Somebody help!

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:01.500
Axle! Oh God. HELP ME. HELP!

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:02.740
*slash over radio*

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:07.380
Radio voice: Hello.

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:10.580
Radio Voice: This is a special message for Sigma Zeta Whirlda.

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:13.813
Radio Voice: The following five of you will die tonight.

00:01:13.813 --> 00:01:15.660
Radio Voice: Nigel Willard.

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:16.974
Radio Voice:Bryce Howe.

00:01:16.974 --> 00:01:18.653
Radio Voice: Katie Sherman.

00:01:18.653 --> 00:01:20.280
Radio Voice: Aden Allen.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:22.080
Radio Voice: And Spike Johnson.

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:25.534
Radio Voice: This is my game and we'll play by my rules.

00:01:25.606 --> 00:01:27.686
Radio Voice: You have one hour.

00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:29.700
What was that?

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:30.200
Aww snap!

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:32.980
Don't speak out of turn gutterslag!

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:34.520
Seriously dude?

00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:35.780
It's just a prank.

00:01:36.035 --> 00:01:37.715
I'm gonna go take a smoke.

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:40.000
Alright. You guys are dismissed.

00:01:40.014 --> 00:01:41.054
Go get dressed.

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:49.380
I'm not even in the frat. I don't get it!

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:53.447
Katie, come on. Axle's just messing with us. It's OK. I promise.

00:02:06.260 --> 00:02:07.540
I can't believe it!

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:10.653
Look, you've had too much to drink tonight and you're freaking out.

00:02:10.653 --> 00:02:11.754
It's gonna be OK.

00:02:11.754 --> 00:02:13.580
That's easy for you to say when your name wasn't called!

00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:15.720
Did you hear?

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:16.780
Yeah. Where's Aden?

00:02:16.993 --> 00:02:18.113
He went out back.

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:29.820
Get inside!

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:38.160
I'm calling the police.

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:39.320
What do we do?

00:02:39.914 --> 00:02:41.674
Lock the door and windows.

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:45.920
Police: M'am, there's nothing I can do.

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:48.200
Police: It's Halloween night. We get a million prank calls.

00:02:49.433 --> 00:02:53.513
No it's not a prank! Our friend is hanging from a fucking tree!

00:02:53.513 --> 00:02:57.660
Police: Look, I can send someone in a little bit, but your friend is probably just messing with you.

00:02:58.040 --> 00:02:58.540
Uhgh!!

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:02.480
That's it. I'm not gonna stay here and wait to die.

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:03.140
Move it Pledge!

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:04.540
Pledge!

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:08.780
No, no, no, no!

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:10.980
Katie!

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:12.100
It's too late! 

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:17.980
He just killed Katie!

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:18.980
What about Nigel and Bryce?!

00:03:20.293 --> 00:03:20.933
Go! Go go!

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:51.200
Oh my God, he's been in the house!

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:56.340
Get to safety!

00:03:58.331 --> 00:03:59.611
What are you doing?

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:01.000
He's only after you!

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:04.120
You stupid Pledge!

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:26.960
Why are you doing this?

00:04:27.140 --> 00:04:28.660
Don't you remember me?

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:30.400
Kevin Peterson?

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:33.460
Or as you would always call me: Sheepshit!

00:04:35.294 --> 00:04:37.214
I never meant to hurt you man!

00:04:39.893 --> 00:04:42.373
What happened to you was an accident!

00:04:42.373 --> 00:04:45.513
You treat Pledges like dirt, and that is no accident.

00:04:45.693 --> 00:04:46.973
DOWN ON YOUR KNEES!

00:04:50.066 --> 00:04:50.786
Now drink.

00:04:57.554 --> 00:05:00.514
You five made my freshman year a living hell.

00:05:01.366 --> 00:05:04.966
I can only imagine that's exactly where you're going.

00:06:50.887 --> 00:06:52.247
The sun will rise...

